[[0,429525,0,4,0,4,"2015-08-19T16:54:30","VladTheVampire","",[],"","'Hitman: Agent 47': Film Review","http://m.hollywoodreporter.com/entry/view/id/992953?utm_source=twitter","AtTheMoviesWithVlad"],[1,1924312,0,1,0,1,"2015-08-19T18:34:09","oxidated","",[],"<p>The best way, in my opinion, to do a hitman movie would be to take the pacing cues less from the Bourne or Bond movies; and more from the Godfather .</p>"],[2,1925519,1924312,1,0,1,"2015-08-19T19:24:25","Whizwicky","",[],"<p>If they did a Bourne style Hitman movie, it would probably work as long as they kept action sequences down to a few seconds instead of having an hour of car chases, massive gunfights, and helicopters crashing through buildings. </p>\n<p>Or you could shoot it like the first hour of Smoking Aces. </p>"],[1,1925715,0,0,0,0,"2015-08-19T19:33:45","Big_Willy_Wallace","",[],"<p>It looks to be another feminized bullshit action movie.</p>"]]
