[[0,429534,0,128,0,128,"2015-08-19T16:59:27","Atko","",[],"<p>I received complaints from several Voat users who received an error telling them &quot;you have been blocked&quot; when they tried to submit a link or comment. We don't have any such mechanisms in our code so I investigated this today and it turns out that our cloudflare configuration was using several irrelevant firewall rulesets which were triggering this error message. These are now disabled and the error message should not be showing anymore. Thank you for reporting this.</p>","\"You were blocked\"","","voatdev"],[1,1922270,0,14,3,11,"2015-08-19T17:06:26","atheist101","[e]",[],"<p>Are you going to edit your post and apologize to the person where you back lashed at them for showing you that people were being blocked from posting where you basically called them a liar and a hater? There was obviously a problem with the site and people recognized it but you hand waived them off as crazy assholes. </p>"],[1,1922529,0,10,1,9,"2015-08-19T17:18:05","dave31175","",[],"<p>Thanks for tracking this down and resovling it, Atko!</p>"],[1,1923343,0,1,0,1,"2015-08-19T17:54:45","FuckedUpFoxy","",[],"<p>That was quick. <strong>Nice</strong></p>"],[1,1925904,0,11,5,6,"2015-08-19T19:42:04","Scandinavian","",[],"<p>Do you think this was a professional and appropriate response to another user posting I had been blocked?</p>\n<p>Atko today:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>We are not blocking anyone from posting anything. There is a daily posting quota for users with negative CCP and you can see this in the sourcecode. <strong>Where is your proof for this IP blocking claim, I'd love to fucking see it?</strong> Protectvoat my ass, you are doing all you can to harm voat.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>I sent a PM to Puttitout with it. My <em>fucking</em> proof is CloudFlare Ray ID: 217ee2fd3745059d - check it yourself.</p>"],[2,1967620,1925904,0,1,-1,"2015-08-21T13:42:21","crankypants15","",[],"<p>AFAIK <a href=\"/user/atko\">@Atko</a> is the only developer on this site, and it's a BIG project with many features. I'm also guessing he has a full-time job, a house, and a family or at least gf to take care of. People get cranky sometimes, even me! </p>\n<p>So, relaaaaaaxx...</p>\n<p>Turn that frown upside down, show a smile for a while!</p>"],[1,1926619,0,8,3,5,"2015-08-19T20:13:33","sweetholymosiah","",[],"<p>lol people became rather offended when you cursed! Such delicate sensibilities...</p>"],[1,1927325,0,1,0,1,"2015-08-19T20:43:55","el_em_en_oh","",[],"<p>Thanks for fixing.</p>\n<p>Got that message yesterday, and was like... wha-wha-what'd I do? (<em>sad wimpery voice</em>)</p>"],[1,1928896,0,0,2,-2,"2015-08-19T21:48:33","Draegur","",[],"<p>Thanks for being up-front with us, <a href=\"/user/atko\">@Atko</a> ! You're awesome and I hope you FEEL awesome!</p>"],[1,1936141,0,1,0,1,"2015-08-20T03:10:14","leixiaotie","",[],"<p>Really? Let me test it... '); insert into comments select top 10 * from comments;</p>"],[2,1936163,1936141,1,0,1,"2015-08-20T03:11:14","leixiaotie","",[],"<p>whoa nice, it works.</p>"],[1,1940781,0,3,1,2,"2015-08-20T07:43:53","vanities","",[],"<p>People getting real petty over you cursing. Express yourself how you want yo express yourself. I'd honestly rather have someone curse with conviction than curtly tell me some ass-kissing customer service response like: &quot;Thank you for your consideration.&quot; </p>\n<p>Keep on rockin'. </p>"]]
[[0,429535,0,1,0,1,"2015-08-19T16:59:32","sugarlush","",[],"<p>I have two young children, 2 years and 7 months old. Before the kids, my wife and I would travel to Europe at least once a year and somewhere else in the States or Canada for another trip. I'm starting to get antsy for that big European trip again and don't want to have to wait years to go back. </p>\n<p>Have any of you traveled with young children? What advice do you have? What issues did you run into while traveling you wish you knew beforehand? </p>","Advice needed for traveling with young children","","travel"],[1,1922339,0,1,1,0,"2015-08-19T17:10:06","ImReallyHighBut","",[],"<p>Diapers books toys snacks and patience </p>"],[2,1923296,1922339,0,0,0,"2015-08-19T17:52:44","sugarlush","",[],"<p>Thanks for the reply. </p>\n<p>Was it easier to buy those things once you got to where you were going? A normal trip to just visit the grandparents involves taking most everything our 7 month has, which I'd to like to avoid. </p>"]]
